  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-12-17T23:39:47.121Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "This will allow us to use Udon to update Global Illumination!\n\nhttps://docs.unity3d.com/ScriptReference/DynamicGI.html\n\nCustom Render Behavior will still be a useful script for simple uses. But this could possibly be a replacement for it. Depending on how much the SDK wants to cater to non-Udon options for content creators.\n\nAs many features as are feasible/safe for the client please!",
